---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PropertyCard from '../components/PropertyCard.astro';
import { site, whatsappHref } from '../config/site';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
import { getProperties } from '../lib/properties';

const properties = await getProperties();
const vatika = properties.find((p) => p.id === 'vatika-green-farm-house');
---

<Base
  title="Farm House Plots near Bilkisganj, Bhopal – Vatika Green"
  description="Farm house plots at Vatika Green Parisar, Khuraniya, near Bilkisganj, Bhopal. Planned layout with 25-foot RCC roads, electrification, water and sewage lines, park and tree-lined green spaces. Direct from the developer."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Farm house plots near Bilkisganj', url: '/farm-house-plots-bilkisganj' }]}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Farm house plots near Bilkisganj</h1>
      <p>
        Vatika Green Parisar at Khuraniya, near Bilkisganj, is our farm house plot layout outside
        Bhopal — for buyers who want more land and more green around them than a city plot allows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {vatika && (
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Vatika Green Farm House</h2>
          <p>Our company-owned farm house project. You buy directly from us, with no agent in between.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="property-grid">
          <PropertyCard property={vatika} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--sage);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>How a farm house plot differs from a residential plot</h2>
        <p>Buyers ask us this often, so it is worth setting out plainly before you visit.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        A farm house plot is usually larger than a city residential plot and sits outside the dense
        built-up area, so there is room for open ground, trees and a boundary around the house
        rather than walls shared with neighbours. People buy them to build a weekend house, to keep
        the land and build later, or simply to hold land near the city.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        Because it sits outside the municipal area, the permissions, the land classification and
        the construction rules are not always the same as for a plot inside Bhopal. What applies
        depends on the specific plot. We will tell you exactly what applies to the plot you are
        looking at, and we would rather you ask us the awkward questions before you buy than after.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);">
        If a plot inside the city suits you better, see our{' '}
        <a href={url('/plots-in-neelbad-bhopal')}>residential plots in Neelbad</a> instead.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>What is already done at Vatika Green</h2>
        <p>The layout work is complete, so you are not buying into an empty field.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="highlights-list">
        <li>25-foot wide RCC internal roads</li>
        <li>Plot demarcations with corner pillars</li>
        <li>Electrification and street lights</li>
        <li>Water line and sewage line</li>
        <li>Park and children's play ground</li>
        <li>Tree-lined green spaces throughout the layout</li>
        <li>Company-owned project — direct sale, no middlemen</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem;color:var(--muted);">
        Plot sizes and prices depend on what is still available in the layout, so we quote them on
        a call rather than publishing a figure that goes stale. Our{' '}
        <a href={url('/buying-a-plot-in-bhopal')}>guide to buying a plot in Bhopal</a> covers the
        documents and the registration process.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--sage);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">See the site at Bilkisganj</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        A farm house plot is hard to judge from a brochure. Tell us a time that suits you and we
        will take you out to the layout and walk it with you.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.75rem;">
        <a href={url('/requirement?need=farm-house')} class="btn btn-primary">Book a site visit</a>
        {site.contact.whatsapp && (
          <a
            href={whatsappHref(site.contact.whatsapp, 'Hello, I am interested in farm house plots at Vatika Green near Bilkisganj.')}
            class="btn btn-outline"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
          >WhatsApp us</a>
        )}
        {site.contact.phone && (
          <a href={`tel:${site.contact.phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`} class="btn btn-outline">Call {site.contact.phone}</a>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
